_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","review_id":"PJlFrHsoE98Lrt2psl-t1A","date":"2011-06-05T10:57:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9332184791564941,"text_excerpt":"I've been wanting to try this place for the longest time and I can safely say that it was worth the wait. Yeah, it's noisy, it's busy but, hey! it's @#$% NEW ORLEANS so get used to it! I got my po'boy fix with a dressed, shrimp po'boy. My wife chose a bacon and blue crab omelette. Both came relatively quick. The po'boy filled the bill with LOTS of tasty fried shrimp inside a toasted French baguette roll with the crisp lettuce and tomato. Excellent. I opted not to get the side of fries and I'm glad I did as this sandwich was filling and satisfying. But that omelette was KILLER!! It filled half the plate, for one thing, and they don't scrimp on the fillings. The crab was really good, compli..."},{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","review_id":"9gYEXu1virricDcCryYLLA","date":"2011-12-15T07:50:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9325090646743774,"text_excerpt":"ok folks, this place is about as touristy as tourist gets, so know that when before you even go. its definitely not there for the locals! but with that being said, as a die hard local, i gotta say i was impressed with the gumbo, which is really good, and with their version of bbq shrimp. prices are reasonable (for those who think it too expensive, get a clue!), the location is great, and the service is pretty good, plus they open for breakfast, and serve a fairly good breakfast. for the idiots that complained about the fries being bland....come on, they're french fries, if you think they are bland there are more than enough condiments provided for you to make them whatever you want them t..."},{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","review_id":"h3UmqSo__N77OjwTkK_L8g","date":"2016-03-25T18:17:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9288914799690247,"text_excerpt":"We went for breakfast. The eggs creole was very good and the biscuits baked to perfection. The lost bread is fantastic. The restaurant is clean. The hostess did an excellent job and quickly explained where the restrooms were! My only complaint is the wait staff seemed a bit preoccupied. It was not at all busy and he had to come back to the table because he forgot our order. I waited forever for a water refill. The service was the slowest I had experienced in the quarter"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","photo_id":"xitejbRbbDOPRVASHuZSMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xitejbRbbDOPRVASHuZSMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.913739800453186},{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","photo_id":"9KDxxVxxtuhxgNvoOpsurQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9KDxxVxxtuhxgNvoOpsurQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8799936771392822},{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","photo_id":"r4HDtXkzmQoHr-IhIC7Ntw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/r4HDtXkzmQoHr-IhIC7Ntw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8580661416053772},{"business_id":"HhR2Lw4DxN_XKQZHG_TImQ","photo_id":"GvTYsBq6Ttcrvl6msYNj7g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/GvTYsBq6Ttcrvl6msYNj7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327611684799194}]},"notebook_case":null}
